After installing this .pkg:

If installed for everyone:
    export DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH="@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH}"

If installed for only yourself:
    export PATH="${HOME}@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/bin:${PATH}"
    export DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH="${HOME}@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH}"

If user facing scripts (gufi_find, gufi_ls, etc.) are required,

If installed for everyone:
    export PYTHONPATH="@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${PYTHONPATH}"

or move

    @CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_common.py
    @CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_config.py

to another directory and add that directory to PYTHONPATH

If installed for only yourself:
    export PYTHONPATH="${HOME}@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${PYTHONPATH}"

or move

    ${HOME}@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_common.py
    ${HOME}@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_config.py

to another directory and add that directory to PYTHONPATH
